description:
Design a module that calculates the even parity bit for an 8-bit input. The module takes an 8-bit input signal and produces a single output bit, which indicates whether the number of high bits (1s) in the input is even. It computes this by dividing the input into two groups, performing a bitwise XOR operation on each group, and further processing the result to obtain the final output, which is the inverted value of the computed parity.
