Design a one-bit XOR gate. The module takes two input signals, A and B, and produces an output X that reflects the exclusive OR of the inputs, meaning that X will be HIGH (1) only when precisely one of the inputs A or B is HIGH. The output is buffered for signal integrity.
module top_module(
    A,
    B,
    X
);

